{"chunk_id": "52cad01e6fca", "area": "event_area", "context_heading": "新型城镇化产业链动态：", "date_hint": "2024年9月20日", "text": "据住房城乡建设部消息，今年1至8月份，全国新开工改造城镇老旧小区4.2万个。其中，江苏、吉林、青海等6个地区开工率超过90%。按计划，今年全国将新开工改造城镇老旧小区5.4万个。", "image_only": false, "classification": {"chunk_id": "52cad01e6fca", "label": "pure_event", "confidence": 0.5, "ontology_value": "low", "reason": "fallback: missing from LLM response", "is_fallback": true}, "final_bucket": "pure_event", "used_fallback": true}
{"chunk_id": "04b9a00b549f", "area": "event_area", "context_heading": "新型城镇化产业链动态：", "date_hint": "2024年9月18日", "text": "9月18日电，住建部数据显示，2024年，全国计划新开工改造城镇老旧小区5.4万个。根据各地统计上报数据，1-8月份，全国新开工改造城镇老旧小区4.2万个。分地区看，江苏、吉林、青海、上海、重庆、江西等6个地区开工率超过90%。", "image_only": false, "classification": {"chunk_id": "04b9a00b549f", "label": "pure_event", "confidence": 0.5, "ontology_value": "low", "reason": "fallback: missing from LLM response", "is_fallback": true}, "final_bucket": "pure_event", "used_fallback": true}
